        "quote": "While significant group differences in depressive symptoms were only sustained at 6-month follow-up (d = 0.42; p = 0.009), albeit depressive symptoms remained in the mild range for the intervention group at 12-month follow-up."
      }
    },
    {
      "question_id": "v3-cbti-03",
      "split": "held-out",
      "span_ordinal": 5,
      "passage_id": "cbti_symptom_followup",
      "article_alias": "cbti",
      "anchor": {
        "block_id": "xml:/article[1]/body[1]/sec[3]/sec[3]/sec[2]/p[2]",
        "start": 406,
        "end": 637,
        "quote": "In the sensitivity analyses with LOCF, greater improvements in both depressive and insomnia symptoms in the app-based CBT-I group compared to the control group were consistently observed throughout post-session 4–12-month follow-up"
      }
    },
    {
      "question_id": "v3-cbti-03",
      "split": "held-out",
      "span_ordinal": 6,
      "passage_id": "cbti_depression_discussion",
      "article_alias": "cbti",
      "anchor": {
        "block_id": "xml:/article[1]/body[1]/sec[4]/p[3]",
        "start": 289,
        "end": 503,
        "quote": "Although depressive symptoms of the intervention group remained in the mild range at 12-month follow-up, we did not detect significant between-group effects due to the large within-group changes in the control arm."
      }
    },
    {
      "question_id": "v3-cbti-03",
      "split": "held-out",
      "span_ordinal": 7,
      "passage_id": "cbti_depression_discussion",
      "article_alias": "cbti",
      "anchor": {
        "block_id": "xml:/article[1]/body[1]/sec[4]/p[3]",
        "start": 977,
        "end": 1124,
        "quote": "Further sensitivity analyses with LOCF demonstrated greater improvements in depressive symptoms in the app-based CBT-I group at 12-month follow-up."
      }
    },
